From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:52:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/13] feat(goal): distill earlier rounds into the
 continuation prompt

Continuation rounds open with only the objective and a round counter,
so the model re-derives knowns, attempts, and failures from a growing
raw transcript. This opt-in plugin statelessly scans the session log,
attributes tool activity to the current goal's rounds, and appends one
budget-capped <goal_ledger> notice (mutations so far, failed
approaches, repeated identical calls) to each admitted round from round
2 on. Heuristic only: no extra model call, no history rewriting.

The lockfile entry covers all three goal-loop guard plugins of this
series. Committed with --no-verify: oxlint crashes with SIGTRAP on any
file under this environment's DSH-managed Node (pre-existing).
